<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 872)</h2>
<ul>
<li>Join a Review&#8217;s review menu is always there, and says so while it looks for reviews on your network.</li>
<li>The Network window fills its frame; a long passphrase shrinks to fit instead of losing its middle; the invite sheet is as wide as its content.</li>
<li>Manual: Join a Review and the Network window pictured; what a slow connection means for you and what your host sees.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
